        "TileImage": "$($repository 3d25ee6c-61fa-4ba5-8f19-fedd905fd8fb).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Respectable art collector, Kalvin Ritter is throwing a party on his Yacht tonight in Syndey, Australia. Ritter was previously a member of &quot;The Yardbirds&quot;, a crime organization who stole priceless art, worth hundreds of millions. According to our client, the party is a cover up for a meeting with an additional target, Terry Norfolk, who is planning to hire Ritter to commit espionage. The meeting should provide an excellent opprotunity to get both targets alone.\rGood luck, 47.",
